Z||000000||BBBAD GT||10-16-2000||11:09 AM||||Bent the inside rim of the rear pass side wheel last week (not exactly sure how it happen).  It not bad, but enough to let out the tire pressure.  Bad thing is that I got these rims on closeout (MiM Vento 16x7), and they don't make them anymore, so I'm stuck with repairing them. <P>Anybody know of a good place to get this done?<P>Horray for the 13yr old space saver spare, it got me approx 100 miles after the flat.  I was stuck in the middle of nowhere, and had to continue my trip out of town for a couple days.  Tip of the day:  Make sure its aired up properly, did that two weeks ago and it came in handy  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/BBBAD_GT_SIG.gif">    <P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/V8Fiero" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD V8</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/Fiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD GT</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD 5.0</A>||||reg||9
