Z||000003||BBBAD GT||10-20-2000||10:41 AM||||Called the place I originally ordered from (discount tire direct), and they had 4 wheels left (when I originally ordered, they said they were the last ones...so go figure).  Got the wheel for same price as before ($65), and new tire, mounted and balanced and shipped to me for $174.  You can't beat that, considering a wheel fix would run at least $100...without shipping and without a new tire.  I'm happy  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>||||reg||14
